WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.020
I'll kill you!

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.280
Amata!

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.360
Cut it out, Andy!

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.490
Let me at him!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:20.360
Why didn't you save Mix?

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.960
Don't say that!

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.080
Amata was busy saving Zessica!

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.840
Zessica!

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.140
Now's not the time to argue!

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.220
Focus on getting Mix back!

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.730
Getting her back?

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.850
You think I'd be here if I knew how to do that?!

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.100
I can't...

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:52.360
After the Gate closed, we couldn't
detect any trace of spatial distortion.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.780
Then how do we save Mix?

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:59.520
Where's the High Commander when we need him?

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.540
He sees something.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.160
The fate of our two worlds...

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:11.380
and where to find the seed of destiny that can change it.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:16.960
Ants...

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:21.060
and their antsy antics.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.490
Mix...

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.300
Why did it have to turn out like this?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.620
I never got to hold you in my arms.

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:10.120
I never got to take those big bangs and...

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:17.000
What the hell am I thinking?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:23.120
I'm such an idiot! Just kill me now! Damn it! Damn it!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.380
Did you eat, Andy?

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.070
He's sent back yesterday's, too.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.580
What else can I do for him?

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.570
Yunoha...

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:50.710
I've lost someone special, too. I don't want Andy to go through the same thing.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.260
Yunoha.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.080
Let me take care of it.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.430
It's been a week.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.140
I hope Mix is all right.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.580
How about Zessica?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.720
Taking another day off.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.060
She's really torn up.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:30.880
I'm so pathetic. I'm an idiot.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:36.260
Why did you save me, Amata?

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:43.720
I know you won't choose me, so all that's left for me here is pain.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.920
That vision again?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.500
Don't be afraid...

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.860
What the... What's going on?!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.490
Don't cry.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:12.120
We're the same, you and I. The unchosen.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.620
What do you mean?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.920
You, the unchosen, must know how it feels.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:26.760
To carelessly take the offered hand, only for it to be snatched away.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:35.560
I can rip off that hand and give it to you.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:42.880
I will give you what you desire. I will open the Dimension Gate.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:48.560
In exchange, I want you to promise me something.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.570
Mikono!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:16.440
Why are you going by yourself to search for the High Commander?

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.540
I don't really understand, either..

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.980
But he told me...

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:27.950
Mikono Suzushiro, your power is to connect those who are divided once more.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:35.330
You connect all the fragmented souls together.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:42.750
And you're the one who said everyone needs to work together now.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:46.760
Connecting people is my job.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.000
But that has...

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:54.300
...nothing to do with this? Maybe.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:59.080
But I can't just sit by uselessly while we lose Mix!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.240
Then I'll go with you!

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:04.320
They'll need you here if Altair attacks again.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:09.800
I'm the only one without a combat Element power.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.820
But...

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:16.080
There's something I've wanted to tell you.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:20.460
But I been keeping it to myself all this time because I was scared.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.900
But when I come back...

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.360
When I come back, I'll say it.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.260
Wait! Mikono!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:42.120
You don't give Amata a break, do you?

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:48.140
Shush seems to like that boy, Kagura,

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.440
but it growls at the rest of us.

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:54.700
You think it doesn't like me or Amata?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.870
I don't think so.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.420
It's just jealous.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.180
That's just how it is.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:06.250
If I get to like anyone, it growls at them.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:10.630
So you do like Amata, Mikono!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.200
I wanted to prevent myself from getting hurt,

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.600
but I ended up hurting Amata and Zessica.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.240
I have to tell him.

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:31.100
First I have to connect everybody and save Mix.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.240
After that...

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.870
A Dimension Gate has opened above the academy!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.620
What?

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.080
So they've finally come out!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:49.840
That's...

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:58.660
This is unusual.

00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.390
What?

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.880
We've not detected any enemy machines!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:02.770
What?

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.420
That's a Gate!

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:05.520
Andy!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.690
We can go to Altair and take Mix back!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.720
Calm down! This could be a trap!

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:13.440
A trap?

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:16.340
Mr. Donar is completely right.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:20.380
The enemy is inviting us in.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.960
I will give you what you desire.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.460
Zessica?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:37.340
We can't send Aquarion to Altair without Fudo's approval.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.720
So you're just going to abandon Mix?

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:44.020
I understand how you feel, Andy, but...

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.770
So we can't do anything for her?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.190
Excuse me.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.480
Commander! I mean, Principal!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:58.800
Chairman Crea, this arrived for you from High Commander Fudo.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.410
A donut?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.980
Eek! Ants!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:08.250
What?

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:12.490
They're gone?

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:13.380
No.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.100
This must be a message from Fudo.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:25.470
Perhaps he is telling us, "Don't hesitate! Leap into the ring!"

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.120
Into the ring?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:31.610
"Else you will never get the sweetness within."

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.400
The sweetness...

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:35.860
That's Mix!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.180
Orders from the High Commander!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.240
Deploy Aquarion at once!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.660
Roger!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.960
For you, all for you.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:52.920
I granted your desire and opened the gate for you.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:56.520
Girl with hair the color of grass,

00:10:56.520 --> 00:11:00.430
you will fulfill your promise in time.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:07.400
And then your turn will come, Kagura.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:12.980
Vector Y, all green.

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:14.980
Ready to deploy any time!

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.520
I'm deeply sorry.

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:23.570
But I will have this seat, my friend.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.300
Cayenne?

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:31.210
But then who's in the Vector?

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.130
Shrade Elan deploying!

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.420
Shrade?!

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.130
I must reach the unknown world and hear its sounds...

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:45.260
to perfect my final melody.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:50.520
I can't do a mixed Union yet. No, I won't.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:55.400
I'm saving my first time for you, Mix!

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:03.030
Infiltration Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:11.120
Aquarion Evol!

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:28.060
It will take time for that soldier's mind to stabilize.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:32.000
But the final steps are already complete.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.560
And those piloting talents are extraordinary.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.820
It may not be the result I was hoping for,

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:42.840
but now that we've lost Jin, we could use an extra fighter.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:45.560
Commander Izumo, the Dimensional Gate has opened!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:48.580
What? Did Mikage make another move?

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:53.460
It takes an enormous amount of
energy to open the Dimension Road.

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:59.460
Each activation drains what precious little energy we have left.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.960
Mikage knows that, and yet...

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.200
Something came through! Where are they?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.680
We... We can't detect them, sir!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.320
No mass or heat readings at all!

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:16.400
What?

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.640
Is the Gate malfunctioning?

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.300
Just a little longer, Yunoha!

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.580
Okay...

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.080
This is Altair?

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.580
What's up with this place?

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.330
The whole surface is covered in metal.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:40.960
Looks like we can get in from there.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:51.470
Are those graves? There are so many...

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:07.900
Yunoha!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:08.880
Are you okay?

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:09.970
I'm fine.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:15.380
But I can only keep them transparent for half a day at best.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.040
We have to find Mix quickly.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:25.050
The sound of this world is an old woman's rasping wail of grief.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:34.310
Slow down, Andy!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:38.310
Hold on, Mix! I'm coming to save you!

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.980
Yunoha, you should've stayed with the Vectors.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.820
I wanted to come.

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:48.340
I wanted to see Jin's world with Tama.

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:02.320
Is that Alicia? That's the Skies of Aquaria!

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.920
Why are they showing a movie from Earth on Altair?

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.560
It's not that weird.

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:13.180
Jin's device had an image of Alicia in it.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:17.180
Mom... You're somewhere on this planet...

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:23.310
Hey, it's an iVision of Alicia!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:26.070
Don't see that every day.

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:32.070
Hey, what's the matter with you? You look funny.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.340
Get away, Yunoha!

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:37.200
You almost look like Iguras.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:41.170
Hey, what are these bags?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.520
Don't touch me!

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:46.600
Zessica!

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:47.920
Creep.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.820
Our Element Suits will attract unwanted attention.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.930
We had best find a change.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.760
This place stinks.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.700
Just keep going, Andy.

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:13.320
There's something else weird about this place.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:21.890
It appears this city is populated only by men.

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:24.580
Or perhaps this entire planet.

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:28.780
Wait. You think that's why they're kidnapping girls?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:32.260
Are you all right, Zessica?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:37.500
My throat's been feeling weird since we got on this planet.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:39.390
Now that you mention it, mine has, too.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.020
Maybe there's something in the air.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.280
I can feel it, too.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:47.680
That building over there...

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.360
Definitely.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:52.040
According to the data Jin left for us...

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.150
So that's the enemy's command center.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:58.410
Well? We don't know if Mix is in there.

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:01.830
Then let's go and see!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:02.660
Right.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.160
Wow.

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:15.480
Andy's digging power is definitely stronger now.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:17.510
Andy, wait!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.200
Intruders detected in the hangar block!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.890
All units, phase one battle stations!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:26.650
We have reports that they are infiltrators from Vega!

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:30.970
We must assume they have Gnis!

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:35.280
Your training may not have prepared you for this type of combat, so stay hidden and stay alert!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.660
Don't move!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.720
I told you not to move!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:45.910
Holes?

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.800
You'd better watch it.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:51.420
I don't know if I can control myself.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.920
Now, you're going to be our guide.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.680
Do as I say, or...

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.140
I'll put a hole in your body.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.800
There they are!

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:09.350
Damn it!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:18.160
Andy, Amata! We'll hold them off here!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.860
You two search for Mix!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:25.000
Be careful, Amata. Don't get into trouble.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.540
Thanks, guys.

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.200
Amata...

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.500
A crude, ugly dissonance.

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:40.930
I will not allow you to interrupt the melody of love!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.820
Contrary Twister!

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:04.700
They're gone.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.180
Good. Get up.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.410
That wound...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.440
Have you found them yet?

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.300
No, sir!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.300
Damn it! Go search Area 83!

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.140
Yes, sir!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.680
Andy, now.

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:33.380
Stop moving.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:37.660
Why would you treat my wound?

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:42.910
Shut it. I don't want them tracking us by your blood trail.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:49.540
Now!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.560
It's a dead end!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:03.300
This elevator is the only way up the tower.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.630
Then open the lock.

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:08.470
Please, we just want to save our friend!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:14.860
And I'll do anything to save that friend, understand?

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.640
Hurry it up!

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.250
Why you...

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:38.980
I figured it out.

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:44.510
I'm not sure why, but you can't kill me.

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:58.520
Amata, get out of here!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.070
But...

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:03.160
If we both get caught, there won't be anyone left to save Mix!

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:06.070
Mix?

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:09.870
I've got this! I'm the immortal Andy!

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:12.580
Go!

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:14.180
Andy...

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:21.300
What?

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:30.890
The suspected Vega infiltrator is headed into the upper block!

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.390
The boy with wings!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:43.920
The Skies of Aquaria?

00:21:58.690 --> 00:21:59.670
That's...

00:22:14.010 --> 00:22:15.400
Mom!

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:23.940
Let me go! Give me back my Mix!

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:28.180
Mix...

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:13.890
Mix, I want you to fill my holes!

00:24:14.330 --> 00:24:16.680
My nostrils long to smell you,

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:19.350
there's a bad feeling in my pores,

00:24:19.890 --> 00:24:25.150
and you've left a gaping hole in my heart.
